{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附顯密寄齊義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附心相顯密義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〡字書古本切又思二切說文上下通也引而上行讀若囟引而下行讀\n若退故古來相傳為退音讀之盇象形矣謂字形象混元氣貫通天地詳猶云一氣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附顯密寄齊義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附心相顯密義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附斷二執義　附觀二空義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附斷二執義　附觀二空義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住心論五附於拔業因種心明小乘成佛是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附顯果密因義　附心中祕密義　附此中十喻義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附沈空七地八地義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附即心之印義　附頓覺成佛義　附直約諸法義　附金剛寶藏義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附顯果密因義　心中祕密義　此中十喻義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前二劫者指他緣一道二\n種住心後二心者示真言門根究竟二心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附沈空七地八地義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至廣說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此地所住真如故捨棃耶之名故云\n住於報行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依內\n證清淨生𣦸涅槃二心不行名二行不現外緣境界受用念想不行故云相行不現"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法流者決彼無生止水令起無功用行河任運趣佛智海即以\n能趣為門又法流者即是行海"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自此已下說七勸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "超第三劫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身證十地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附即心之印義　附頓覺成佛義　附直約諸法義　附金剛寶藏義"}
